            "notes": "### \ud83d\udcab Items:\n\n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) & [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) should now be picked up when you've met the cost requirements or more, as taking [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) should make the Weapon Power percentage a bit more noticeable.\n\n- For this round, taking items to increase your [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)  should now start being prioritized, as you want to increase the speed at which you eliminate your designated squishy targets. \n\n- If you're gaining cash to buy more Rare items, I suggest selling [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) & [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) to start. \n\n### \u2694\ufe0f Playstyles & Notes:\n\n- Your playstyle should be relatively the same as mentioned in the Round 1 Notes & similar to playing as a good D.va player.",
