            "notes": "### \u26a1\ufe0fPowers:\n\n- [Overstocked](item_d6b946fd-0fd8-4ba1-85d0-601995136eb6) is now your next priority. Should you miss out on an elimination, this should generally help finishing your opponent off.\n\n- If your teammates are being harassed too much or you're taking too much damage, take [Ultrawide Matrix](item_403fe162-4a59-4a8e-8af9-5f83267228e8) early to ease the pressure.\n\n### \ud83d\udcab Items:\n\n- Now you just need to start taking more Rare items that grant [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) . Don't try to force out too many Rare items if it leaves you with open slots. Take  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418), [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295), and DPS increasing items to fill up those slots.\n\n### \u2694\ufe0f Playstyles & Notes:\n\n- This round should be a good power spike, as you'll be capable to kill an opponent with a single barrage as it is ongoing, so long as you weave your Fusion Cannons (Primary Fire) with your Micro Missiles. However, this is of course more difficult to do if the target you have in mind is being healed and is dodging rapidly.",
