            "notes": "### \ud83d\udcab Items:\n\n- [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) should be your first Epic item, as it should now be possible to gain Self-Destruct (Ultimate ability) within the first fight of each round. \n\n- You may opt for items like [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) or [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) if you want more damage output or are having trouble with pocket healers (that is to say, people who heal a certain individual on their team WAY TOO MUCH). \n\n### \u2694\ufe0f Playstyles & Notes:\n\n- Since you have [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) now, it is more imperative that you take a bit more risky dives into your enemy team's squishies to take them down with the standard combo (Primary Fire & Micro Missiles). \n\n- Take areas that are much closer to your opponents while having enough time to use your Boosters to escape to a line of sight that your supports can access. Should you fail, use Self-Destruct, walk away from your opponents line of sight, and wait for a new mech.",
