            "notes": "### \u26a1\ufe0fPowers:\n\n- [Ultrawide Matrix](item_403fe162-4a59-4a8e-8af9-5f83267228e8) is something you should now be eyeing, as it should be generally good against a lot of characters and increase you or your teammates' survivability.\n\n- Optionally, take [Ignition Burst](item_52bbc55a-2003-424a-99a0-a53e4941ec58) if you're facing more than one character like [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49), [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1), [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457) and such whom of which want to be very close to their targets. The lava should either force them off of spots they would want to be in, or take passive damage that scales with your [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and charge up your Self-Destruct.\n\n### \ud83d\udcab Items:\n\n- [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) is the next item to grab, as it has a lot that is useful. More [Ability Power](stat_ability_power), increase in [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction), and Overhealth when you use Self-Destruct and Call Mech to keep yourself alive while in your baby form (not in mech).\n\n- The only items I would possibly consider here are [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) if you have extra money, or [Onslaught Ordinance](item_aa2a5d6d-0f8f-4b27-a44e-331832ec11fa) if you want to absolutely ensure those kills with Micro Missiles.\n\n### \u2694\ufe0f Playstyles & Notes:\n\n- Your reminder that you should be taking high ground, raining missiles from above and to scout out your next victi- I mean target to use Boosters towards. I said target.\n\n- With the start of gaining more [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction), you want to speed up your diving and exiting strategy and be aware of the timing.",
