            "notes": "### \ud83d\udcab Items:\n\n- [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) should now be taken, as it is a big damage spike you will gain to annihilate your opponents from the high ground or up close. \n\n- Grab either [Onslaught Ordinance](item_aa2a5d6d-0f8f-4b27-a44e-331832ec11fa) or [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) if you are just under the required amount. \n\n- If you still are lacking the money to do either of the above, buy as many Rare items as you can such as [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6), [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56), [Vesuvius Protocol](item_04b6ec44-8349-4e12-9ea7-a316bee18995) and such. \n\n- Consider taking [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) if you need some more survivability, as the passive healing in addition to more [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) should make you last longer.\n\n\u2694\ufe0f Playstyles & Notes:\n\n- Should be the same as mentioned previously. Play the high ground to rain missiles and for scouting new victims.\n\n- One thing I should mention, however, is to still play cautious. It is very easy to get lost in grabbing those kills and you'll eventually find yourself without a mech and cut off from your team often. Make sure to keep watch over your team on their callouts when they need help.",
